  "contracts": [
    "Supported catalog fields vary per importer/API; fields/variants are not universally populated.",
    "Public ID versus case-insensitive reference/source/SKU lookup and ambiguity.",
    "Parent serializer includes parent/default representation plus kept variants.",
    "API Products has no stock/state/sellable quantity parameters; metadata and internal in-stock fallback are not confirmed stock.",
    "Shopify/VTEX availability lookup versus Woo/Wix mappings and cache/delay boundaries.",
    "Amounts/currencies/converted amounts versus integer order-item quantity; custom_store unit amount, Shopify imported line total.",
    "Async Meta feed destination requires eligible active kept nonzero-price products, not automatic checkout/purchase.",
    "Object/readback versus real tracking event, authorization/identity/consent, reconciliation and uncertain write retries.",
    "PATCH variants empty removal risk; preserve ID mapping and use documented individual variant operations."
  ]
